## Purpose

This plan establishes MedSync Health's procedures for detecting, responding to, containing, and recovering from security incidents. It ensures coordinated, efficient response to minimize impact on operations and customers.

---

## Scope

This plan applies to all information security incidents affecting:
- MedSync production systems and data
- Customer data (including PHI)
- Corporate IT systems
- Employee devices and accounts
- Third-party integrations

