## Incident Response Phases

### Phase 1: Detection & Identification

**Objective**: Identify and validate security incidents quickly.

| Detection Source | Response |
|------------------|----------|
| SIEM Alert | SOC triage within 15 min |
| User Report | Acknowledge within 1 hour |
| Automated Scan | Review within 4 hours |
| Third-Party Report | Validate within 1 hour |
| Customer Report | Escalate immediately |

**Identification Steps**:
1. Validate the alert/report
2. Gather initial information
3. Classify severity level
4. Create incident ticket
5. Notify Incident Commander (P1/P2)

### Phase 2: Containment

**Objective**: Limit the scope and impact of the incident.

| Containment Type | When Used | Examples |
|------------------|-----------|----------|
| Short-term | Immediate threat | Isolate system, block IP |
| Long-term | Sustained threat | Network segmentation |
| Evidence Preservation | All incidents | Log collection, imaging |

**Containment Checklist**:
- [ ] Isolate affected systems
- [ ] Block malicious IPs/domains
- [ ] Disable compromised accounts
- [ ] Preserve evidence (logs, memory)
- [ ] Implement temporary controls
- [ ] Assess spread to other systems

### Phase 3: Eradication

**Objective**: Remove the threat and root cause.

| Activity | Owner |
|----------|-------|
| Malware removal | Security Operations |
| Vulnerability patching | Engineering |
| Credential rotation | IAM Team |
| Configuration fixes | DevOps |
| Third-party coordination | CISO |

### Phase 4: Recovery

**Objective**: Restore systems to normal operation.

| Activity | Criteria |
|----------|----------|
| System restoration | Clean backup verified |
| Service restoration | Testing complete |
| Monitoring enhancement | Extra logging enabled |
| Validation | Security team sign-off |
| Customer communication | As appropriate |

### Phase 5: Post-Incident

**Objective**: Learn from the incident and improve.

| Activity | Timeline | Owner |
|----------|----------|-------|
| Post-Incident Review (PIR) | Within 5 days | Incident Commander |
| Root Cause Analysis | Within 10 days | Technical Lead |
| Lessons Learned | Within 14 days | Full IRT |
| Action Items | Track to completion | CISO |
| Report to Leadership | Within 7 days | CISO |

