## Breach Notification Procedures

### Determination Process

| Step | Action | Timeline |
|------|--------|----------|
| 1 | Identify PHI/PII involved | Immediate |
| 2 | Assess unauthorized access | < 24 hours |
| 3 | Conduct 4-factor risk assessment | < 48 hours |
| 4 | Determine if breach occurred | < 72 hours |
| 5 | Initiate notifications | Per requirements |

### Notification Requirements

| Requirement | Entity | Timeline |
|-------------|--------|----------|
| Covered Entity | Per BAA | 24-72 hours |
| OCR | Via CE | 60 days |
| State AG | If required | Per state law |
| Individuals | Via CE | 60 days |
| Media | If >500 in state | 60 days |

