## Evidence Handling

### Evidence Collection

| Evidence Type | Collection Method | Retention |
|---------------|-------------------|-----------|
| System Logs | Automated export | 7 years |
| Memory Dumps | Volatility/LiME | Per incident |
| Disk Images | FTK/dd | Per incident |
| Network Captures | Packet capture | Per incident |
| Screenshots | Manual | Per incident |
| Interview Notes | Documented | 7 years |

### Chain of Custody

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| Documentation | Evidence log with timestamps |
| Access Control | Limited to IRT |
| Integrity | Hash verification |
| Storage | Encrypted, access logged |
| Transfer | Documented handoff |

